# Roamly - Hotel & Stay Booking Platform
Roamly is a full-stack accommodation booking platform that allows users to discover, review, and manage various types of stays, including hotels, villas, apartments, hostels, homestays, farmhouses, camps, treehouses, and more.

## Live Demo
Live Website: https://roamly-project.onrender.com
## GitHub Repository
Repository: https://github.com/Siddhant-hub895/Roamly-project

## Features
### User Authentication & Authorization
Secure user registration and login
Authentication using Passport.js
Authorization to restrict unauthorized actions

### Property Listings
Create, edit, and delete listings
View detailed listing information

### Location Services
Interactive maps using Mapbox
Property location visualization

### Reviews & Ratings
Add reviews and ratings
Delete own reviews
Display user-generated feedback

### Cloud Storage
Image upload and management using Cloudinary

### Security & Validation
Input validation using Joi
Custom middleware for route protection
Centralized error handling

##  Tech Stack
### Frontend
HTML5
CSS3
Bootstrap
EJS

### Backend
Node.js
Express.js

### Database
-MongoDB

### Authentication
Passport.js
Express Session

### Third-Party Services
Cloudinary (Image Storage)
Mapbox (Location & Maps)

## Project Architecture
The application follows the MVC (Model-View-Controller) Architecture:
Models → Database schemas and logic
Views → EJS templates and UI
Controllers → Business logic and request handling
Routes → Application endpoints
Middleware → Authentication, authorization, validation, and error handling

